  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato, zucchini and carrot into bite-sized chunks. Slice red onion into thick wedges.\n• Spread prepped veggies across two lined oven trays. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat. Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b960ea531bb67743040dfd/step-403dec2e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While veggies are roasting, roughly chop walnuts and set aside.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. Pick the thyme leaves.\n• When veggies have 5 minutes remaining, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over a medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the honey, mixed sesame seeds and thyme and cook, turning haloumi, until fragrant and coated, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b960ea531bb67743040dfd/step-9b2fd79e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the roasted veggie trays, add baby spinach leaves and a drizzle of red wine vinegar and olive oil.\n• Gently toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b960ea531bb67743040dfd/step-ff446f51.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie salad between plates. Top with honey, thyme and sesame haloumi.\n• Sprinkle with walnuts to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61b960ea531bb67743040dfd/step-013b7ae6.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
